# Build context for the Vøling image is the repo root (so fasade/pipeline is
# available). Keep it small and free of local state — the Dockerfile runs
# `npm ci` + `next build` fresh, so none of the following is needed and some
# of it (data/, .env) must never be uploaded or baked into a layer.
**/node_modules
**/.next
fasade/web/data
.git
.github
.claude
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
